Package: prism
Type: Package
Title: Covariance Identification Bounds for Scaled Compositional Systems
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Maxwell", "Konnaris",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "mak6930@psu.edu"
  )
Author: Maxwell Konnaris [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Maxwell Konnaris <mak6930@psu.edu>
Description: Estimates entrywise identification regions and bootstrap
    confidence intervals for absolute log-covariances when compositional
    observations are accompanied by exact, bounded, or sample-level scale
    information. Composition uncertainty is represented through replaceable
    estimator objects. A Dirichlet-multinomial estimator is provided as the
    default.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    parallel,
    stats
Suggests:
    CVXR,
    ECOSolveR,
    pkgload,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
